{"comment": "Hand 1 is dealt with its blinds posted: heads up, the button alice posts the small blind and acts first. Each player sees only its own hole cards. Only the seat to act is given its legal moves, what it must call and the range a bet or raise may go to (a street total); every other seat gets [] and zeros."}
{"comment": "bob may not act out of turn, and alice may not raise below the minimum; neither moves the game on."}
